cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite GVHMR (Shen et al., SIGGRAPH Asia 2024) for the lifting step."
type: software
title: "wgvp: WearGait video-to-pose pipeline"
abstract: "Subject selection, IMU synchronisation and GVHMR lifting for two-view gait-laboratory video. Finds the two tiled camera views, identifies the consented participant among everyone in the room by cross-correlating each person's pelvis motion with the pelvis accelerometer, synchronises the video to the recording timeline, lifts the participant to SMPL-X body parameters per view, and reconciles the views. Only pose-level derivatives leave the site."
authors:
